<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Onsale prices within range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Onsale prices within range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			   Onsale Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $6</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $6 - $7</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,500,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares and estimated price range for the initial public offering in Onsale Inc were reduced.</p>
<p>The company proposed 2.5 million shares from 2.8 million shares previously. The estimated price range was reduced to $6 to $7 from $8 to $10.</p>
<p>The initial public offering became effective on Thursday.</p>
</text>
